# Supabase auth — required for the login screen to activate.
#
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. In the dashboard: Project Settings → API
# 3. Copy the "Project URL" and the "anon / public" key below.
# 4. Save this file as ".env.local" (Vite only exposes vars prefixed with VITE_).
# 5. When deploying, set these same two variables in your Vercel / Netlify project.
#
# The anon key is meant to be used in the browser — it is protected by Supabase
# Row Level Security, not kept secret. Never put the service_role key here.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
